        },
        "text_aPPKTz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>That shared vision changed the relationship.</p><p>Sportbiz and HUNDRED took the next step together, creating a dedicated European company focused entirely on building the brand across the continent.</p><p>This gave HUNDRED something essential to its global ambition:</p>",
            "style": "normal"
          }
        },
        "text_Ffz8xd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A strong local organisation with the freedom, knowledge and infrastructure to build HUNDRED specifically for Europe.</p>",
            "style": "callout"
          }
        },
        "text_DCGDQU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>From athletes and retailers to clubs, content, e-commerce and communities, the goal is to create a brand that feels global – but never distant.</p>",
            "style": "normal"
          }
        },
